Based on the code snippet provided above, its bug. We dont check the array elements if they have parens around them or not. Since in the above case the elements of the array are [`Literal`,  `Identifier`].

I am not sure what the best solution would here since you can keep putting things inside parens.
like 

``` js
var a = [
    (
        (
            "temp"
        )
    ),
    abc
];
```

